<%# What personal information the page shows, said before the data. Not gated
    on any role: whoever can read the page can read the details, so everyone
    gets the reminder.
    Locals: shows (String) -- the fields the page displays, e.g.
    "home addresses and email addresses". %>
<%= ui_callout_box :warning, icon: "hand", title: "Personal Information" do %>
  This report shows <%= shows %>.
  Contact information is only for The BRC Ranger department use.
<% end %>
